# Lesson 2 — boxes
#
# A box is a place to keep a value. You give the box a name,
# put something in it, and then you can ask for it later.

make a box called age
put 9 in age

say "I am ", age, " years old"

# Try changing the number on line 8 and run the lesson again.
# You can also use the short form to make and fill a box:
#
#     name is "Boxy"
#     say name
